OL,3,ATaylor Swift and Beyonce lead tributes
OL,4,Aafter death of 'bold and brilliant'
OL,5,ADolly Parton
OL,6,
OL,7,FTaylor Swift, Beyonce, Sir Paul
OL,8,FMcCartney and Sir Elton John have led
OL,9,Fan outpouring of tributes from
OL,10,Fcelebrities and fans to Dolly Parton
OL,11,Ffollowing the music icon's death at the
OL,12,Fage of 80.
OL,14,FSwift said Parton's "legacy will be an
OL,15,Feverlasting one", while Beatles legend
OL,16,FSir Paul called her a "magnificent
OL,17,Fstar".
OL,19,FThe Tennessee-born singer and
OL,20,Fsongwriter died on Tuesday at the age
OL,21,Fof 80 after "a brief battle with
OL,22,Fcancer", her team said in a statement.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
